>>
Rule 1 (image tensor must be at least three-dimensional)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 3
>>
Rule 2 (inner 3 dimensions of image must be positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [ndim(v_1) - 3, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 3 (image tensor must have a real numeric dtype: int/uint8/float)
{v_1 : tensor} |= 1 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8
>>
Rule 4 (the product of the last three dims must be positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 3) * shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2) * shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) > 0
>>
Rule 6 (last three dimensions of image must be positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 3 ∧ ∀i ∈ [ndim(v_1) - 3, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
